WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Is it sold in your store?

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:03,880
I do sell this brand in my store. What happened?

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,960
There was a milk tea shop half a day ago

4
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,360
A small-scale mass incident occurred

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:08,920
The reason is this coffee

6
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:09,880
People who have drunk related coffee

7
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,520
Hospitalized if symptoms of poisoning occur within a week

8
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,600
The milk tea shop owner said

9
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,800
The goods come in from you

10
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,800
Yunfeng milk tea shop

11
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,040
Now we have to trouble you to follow us

12
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,000
Go back and cooperate with the investigation

13
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,680
Stores may also need to temporarily close

14
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,240
Later, the market supervision department will contact you, comrade police. This is not right.

15
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,640
We have indeed supplied Yunfeng Milk Tea before.

16
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,280
But it stopped a week ago

17
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:31,440
In the past, there was monitoring of how much and when to deliver every day, and they delivered it on the same day.

18
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:35,090
Basically, the police officers can be sold out.

19
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:42,140
Can you let me see the bottle? Can Dashan get a bottle of our own?
